msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/adequacyUnderStandardFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "adequacyUnderStandard is functional"
msgstr "adequacyUnderStandard 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/adequacyUnderStandardFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:adequacyUnderStandard is functional: a single reified gmeow:AdequacyAssessment judges its support against exactly one named gmeow:EpistemicStandard, so the assessment fixes one standard as the bar it measures against. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:adequacyUnderStandard 是函数性的:单一个具体化的 gmeow:AdequacyAssessment 恰好针对一个具名的 gmeow:EpistemicStandard 来评判其支持度,因此该评估将一个标准固定为其衡量的基准。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/attributedKnowerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "attributedKnower is functional"
msgstr "attributedKnower 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/attributedKnowerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:attributedKnower is functional: one gmeow:KnowledgeAttribution credits exactly one agent with the knowing — the single knower it is about, which may equal the attributing agent for self-attribution but is never plural within one attribution."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:attributedKnower 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:KnowledgeAttribution 恰好将知晓归于一个主体——即其所涉及的唯一知晓者,在自我归属的情况下可能与归属主体相同,但在同一归属内绝不会是复数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/attributedPropositionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "attributedProposition is functional"
msgstr "attributedProposition 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/attributedPropositionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:attributedProposition is functional: one gmeow:KnowledgeAttribution is about exactly one proposition attributed as known, so a single non-factive 'takes themselves to know' attribution names one propositional target and entails no truth of it. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:attributedProposition 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:KnowledgeAttribution 恰好涉及一个被归属为已知的命题,因此单一条非实然的『自认为知道』('takes themselves to know')归属只命名一个命题目标,且不蕴含其为真。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/attributingAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "attributingAgent is functional"
msgstr "attributingAgent 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/attributingAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:attributingAgent is functional: one gmeow:KnowledgeAttribution has exactly one agent making it — the single attributer whose standpoint the credited knowing is reported from, never two co-attributers within one attribution."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:attributingAgent 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:KnowledgeAttribution 恰好由一个主体作出——即从其立场报告所归功之知晓的唯一归属者,同一归属内绝不会有两个共同归属者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/claimOfBeliefFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "claimOfBelief is functional"
msgstr "claimOfBelief 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/claimOfBeliefFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:claimOfBelief is functional: one gmeow:DoxasticStandpointClaim reports exactly one held gmeow:DoxasticState — the single believing mode the claim is the vantage-indexed report of, so the reporting claim binds to one underlying belief. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:claimOfBelief 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:DoxasticStandpointClaim 恰好报告一个所持有的 gmeow:DoxasticState——即该主张作为立场索引式报告所对应的唯一信念模式——因此该报告性主张绑定于唯一一个基础信念。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/doxasticClaimFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "doxasticClaim is functional"
msgstr "doxasticClaim 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/doxasticClaimFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:doxasticClaim is functional: one gmeow:DoxasticState carries its qualitative belief value through exactly one gmeow:StandpointClaim — the single bridge whose claimModality supplies the state's modality without domain-clashing claimModality onto DoxasticState. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:doxasticClaim 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:DoxasticState 恰好通过一个 gmeow:StandpointClaim 承载其定性信念值——即由其 claimModality 提供该状态情态的唯一桥梁，从而避免 claimModality 与 DoxasticState 发生域冲突。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/doxasticContentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "doxasticContent is functional"
msgstr "doxasticContent 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/doxasticContentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:doxasticContent is functional: one gmeow:DoxasticState is constitutively directed at exactly one gmeow:Proposition — the single truth-apt content the believing mode is about, so a state directed at two propositions would be two distinct believings. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:doxasticContent 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:DoxasticState 在构成上恰好指向一个 gmeow:Proposition——即该信念模式所关涉的唯一可真可假的内容，因此指向两个命题的状态将是两个不同的信念。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/epistemicAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "epistemicAgent is functional"
msgstr "epistemicAgent 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/epistemicAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:epistemicAgent is functional: one gmeow:DoxasticState constitutively inheres in exactly one gmeow:Agent — the single believer whose believing mode it is, since a mental moment inheres in one bearer and cannot be shared across agents."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:epistemicAgent 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:DoxasticState 在构成上恰好内在于一个 gmeow:Agent ——即该信念模式所属的唯一信念持有者，因为一个心理时刻内在于单一承载者，无法在多个主体之间共享。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/evaluatesFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "evaluates is functional"
msgstr "evaluates 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/evaluatesFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:evaluates is functional: one gmeow:ClaimEvaluation assesses exactly one target gmeow:ClaimToken — the single assertion act it judges under its context — even though that one token may in turn be assessed by many coexisting evaluations. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:evaluates 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:ClaimEvaluation 恰好评估一个目标 gmeow:ClaimToken ——即它在其语境下所判定的唯一断言行为——尽管该同一令牌反过来可能被许多并存的评估所评估。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/knowerAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "knowerAgent is functional"
msgstr "knowerAgent 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/knowerAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:knowerAgent is functional: one reified gmeow:KnowledgeClaim has exactly one knowing agent — the single subject the locally-factive knowing relation is anchored on, so the claim reifies one agent's knowing, not a collective."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:knowerAgent 是函数性的:一个具体化的 gmeow:KnowledgeClaim 恰好有一个认知主体——即局部实然的认知关系所锚定的那个单一主体——因此该主张具体化的是一个主体的认知,而不是一个集体的认知。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/knownInWorldFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "knownInWorld is functional"
msgstr "knownInWorld 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/knownInWorldFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:knownInWorld is functional: one gmeow:KnowledgeClaim is locally factive in exactly one gmeow:EpistemicContext — the single belief-world its known proposition holds in, since factivity is world-relative and a second world would be a second knowing claim. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:knownInWorld 是函数式的:一个 gmeow:KnowledgeClaim 恰好在一个 gmeow:EpistemicContext 中具有局部真实性——即其已知命题成立的那个唯一信念世界,因为真实性是相对于世界而言的,第二个世界将构成第二个知识断言。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/knownPropositionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "knownProposition is functional"
msgstr "knownProposition 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/knownPropositionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:knownProposition is functional: one reified gmeow:KnowledgeClaim is about exactly one known gmeow:Proposition — the single propositional content the knowing relation ranges over, so one claim reifies knowing one proposition in its world under its standard. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:knownProposition 是函数式的:一个被具体化的 gmeow:KnowledgeClaim 恰好关于一个已知的 gmeow:Proposition——即该知晓关系所涉及的唯一命题内容——因此一个断言在其世界中、依据其标准,具体化了对一个命题的知晓。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/meetsThresholdFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "meetsThreshold is functional"
msgstr "meetsThreshold 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/meetsThresholdFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:meetsThreshold is functional: one gmeow:AdequacyAssessment carries exactly one solver-set gmeow:AdequacyVerdict — met, unmet, or undetermined — since a single assessment against one standard resolves to one verdict, never to conflicting outcomes at once."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:meetsThreshold 是函数式的:一个 gmeow:AdequacyAssessment 恰好携带一个由求解器设定的 gmeow:AdequacyVerdict——已满足、未满足或未确定——因为针对一项标准的单次评估只解析为一个裁定,绝不会同时得出相互矛盾的结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/supportGroundFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "supportGround is functional"
msgstr "supportGround 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/supportGroundFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:supportGround is functional: one gmeow:SupportAssessment weighs exactly one gmeow:JustificationGround — the single ground whose warranting strength it measures under one standard, so a second ground would be a separate support assessment. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:supportGround 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:SupportAssessment 恰好权衡一个 gmeow:JustificationGround——即它在一种标准下衡量其担保强度的唯一依据,第二个依据将构成一次独立的支持评估。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/supportUnderStandardFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "supportUnderStandard is functional"
msgstr "supportUnderStandard 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/supportUnderStandardFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:supportUnderStandard is functional: one gmeow:SupportAssessment measures support relative to exactly one named gmeow:EpistemicStandard — the single bar its strength is indexed to, so assessing the same ground under a second standard is a distinct assessment. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:supportUnderStandard 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:SupportAssessment 恰好相对于一个具名的 gmeow:EpistemicStandard 衡量支持度——即其强度所参照的唯一标杆,因此在第二种标准下评估同一依据将构成一次不同的评估。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tenureOfDoxasticStateFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "tenureOfDoxasticState is functional"
msgstr "tenureOfDoxasticState 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tenureOfDoxasticStateFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:tenureOfDoxasticState is functional: one gmeow:DoxasticTenure scopes exactly one gmeow:DoxasticState — the single believing whose holding interval it records — so a revised belief opens a fresh state and a fresh tenure rather than re-pointing this one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:tenureOfDoxasticState 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:DoxasticTenure 恰好限定一个 gmeow:DoxasticState——即它所记录其持有区间的那唯一一种信念——因此经修订的信念会开启一个新的状态与一个新的保有,而不是重新指向这一个。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/underStandardFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "underStandard is functional"
msgstr "underStandard 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/underStandardFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:underStandard is functional: one reified gmeow:KnowledgeClaim is held to exactly one gmeow:EpistemicStandard — the single ordinary, scientific, or legal bar under which the knowing counts — so the same knowing under a different standard is a separate claim. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:underStandard 是函数性的:一个具象化的 gmeow:KnowledgeClaim 恰好受一个 gmeow:EpistemicStandard 约束——即该项知晓据以成立的唯一日常、科学或法律门槛——因此同一知晓在不同标准下应视为一项独立主张。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/adequacyUnderStandardFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:adequacyUnderStandard names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:adequacyUnderStandard 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/adequacyUnderStandardFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/adequacyUnderStandardFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:adequacyUnderStandard, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:adequacyUnderStandard, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/adequacyUnderStandardFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:adequacyUnderStandardFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:adequacyUnderStandard ."
msgstr "gmeow:adequacyUnderStandardFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:adequacyUnderStandard ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/attributedKnowerFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:attributedKnower names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:attributedKnower 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/attributedKnowerFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/attributedKnowerFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:attributedKnower, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:attributedKnower, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/attributedKnowerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:attributedKnowerFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:attributedKnower ."
msgstr "gmeow:attributedKnowerFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:attributedKnower ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/attributedPropositionFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:attributedProposition names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:attributedProposition 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/attributedPropositionFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/attributedPropositionFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:attributedProposition, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:attributedProposition, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/attributedPropositionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
