msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DoxasticStateCredenceRangeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "DoxasticState credence range constraint"
msgstr "DoxasticState 置信度取值范围约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DoxasticStateCredenceRangeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A validation-only integrity constraint: when present, a DoxasticState's gmeow:credence is an xsd:decimal in [0.0, 1.0]."
msgstr "仅用于验证的完整性约束：DoxasticState 的 gmeow:credence 若存在，则是位于 [0.0, 1.0] 区间内的 xsd:decimal。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DoxasticStateJustifierWarningConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "DoxasticState justifier-type warning constraint"
msgstr "DoxasticState 理据类型警告约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DoxasticStateJustifierWarningConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world advisory constraint: a gmeow:DoxasticState's gmeow:hasAvailableEvidence or gmeow:basesBeliefOn value should be a gmeow:EvidenceSpan, gmeow:Attestation, or gmeow:DoxasticState."
msgstr "闭世界建议性约束：gmeow:DoxasticState 的 gmeow:hasAvailableEvidence 或 gmeow:basesBeliefOn 的取值宜为 gmeow:EvidenceSpan、gmeow:Attestation 或 gmeow:DoxasticState。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ClaimEvaluation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Mint one ClaimEvaluation per (token, context) assessment; point gmeow:evaluates at the target gmeow:ClaimToken, gmeow:accordingTo at the gmeow:Standpoint context, and gmeow:expresses at the verdict proposition; carry the qualitative verdict as its claim modality. When the same evaluator revises its own evaluation, mint a new evaluation and suppress the old one with gmeow:displayable false (Principle 10). An evaluation by another party never sets the flag on the claim it evaluates: both stay retrievable and a reader's projection decides what is shown. Give the evaluator's reason in its own words with gmeow:statedRationale on the evaluation. To evaluate a claim that exists only as an RDF 1.2 reified statement, evaluate the claim token its reifier is linked to by gmeow:putForwardByClaim."
msgstr "为每一次（令牌、语境）评估创建一个 ClaimEvaluation；用 gmeow:evaluates 指向目标 gmeow:ClaimToken，用 gmeow:accordingTo 指向 gmeow:Standpoint 语境，用 gmeow:expresses 指向裁决命题；以主张模态承载定性裁决。同一评估者修订自己的评估时，创建新的评估，并用 gmeow:displayable false 隐藏旧评估（原则 10）。另一方作出的评估绝不会在其所评估的主张上设置该标志：两者都保持可检索，向读者展示什么由读者的投影决定。用 gmeow:statedRationale 在评估上以评估者自己的措辞给出其理由。要评估仅以 RDF 1.2 具体化陈述形式存在的主张，应评估其具体化者经 gmeow:putForwardByClaim 所关联的主张令牌。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ClaimToken|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A single datable assertion act — one source, on one occasion, putting one or more propositions forward under an assertoric force. A perdurant WITH PROVENANCE (a gmeow:Activity): performed by an agent via gmeow:wasAssociatedWith, held according to a frame via gmeow:accordingTo, datable on the event. The claim TOKEN is distinct from the propositional content it expresses (gmeow:expresses → gmeow:Proposition), from the attitude held toward it (gmeow:heldByAttitude → gmeow:DoxasticState or teleology gmeow:IntentionalMode), and from any evaluation of it (gmeow:ClaimEvaluation). One proposition may be expressed by many coexisting tokens, and one token may express several propositions (Principle 9); a token its own asserter withdraws is suppressed (gmeow:displayable false, Principle 10) without erasing the content it expressed, while a token that another party disputes, corrects or evaluates takes no flag from that act."
msgstr "单次可确定日期的断言行为——一个来源在一次场合下，以某种断言力提出一个或多个命题。一个带有出处的持续体（gmeow:Activity）：由代理通过 gmeow:wasAssociatedWith 执行，依据某个框架通过 gmeow:accordingTo 持有，可在事件上确定日期。主张令牌有别于它所表达的命题内容（gmeow:expresses → gmeow:Proposition）、对它所持的态度（gmeow:heldByAttitude → gmeow:DoxasticState 或目的论 gmeow:IntentionalMode）以及对它的任何评估（gmeow:ClaimEvaluation）。一个命题可由许多并存的令牌表达，一个令牌也可表达多个命题（原则 9）；其断言者自己撤回的令牌会被隐藏（gmeow:displayable false，原则 10），但不抹去它所表达的内容，而被另一方质疑、更正或评估的令牌不会因该行为而获得标志。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ClaimToken|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Mint one ClaimToken per assertion act; link its content with gmeow:expresses (one or many propositions), its performing agent with gmeow:wasAssociatedWith, its frame with gmeow:accordingTo; attach the reported attitude with gmeow:heldByAttitude and the producing event via the inverse of gmeow:producesClaim; evaluations reference it via gmeow:evaluates. When its own asserter withdraws it, suppress it (gmeow:displayable false), never delete it (Principle 10); never set the flag because another party disputes, corrects or evaluates it."
msgstr "为每次断言行为创建一个 ClaimToken；用 gmeow:expresses 链接其内容（一个或多个命题），用 gmeow:wasAssociatedWith 链接执行代理，用 gmeow:accordingTo 链接其框架；用 gmeow:heldByAttitude 附加所报告的态度，经由 gmeow:producesClaim 的逆关系附加产生它的事件；评估通过 gmeow:evaluates 引用它。其断言者自己撤回它时，将其隐藏（gmeow:displayable false），绝不删除（原则 10）；绝不因另一方质疑、更正或评估它而设置该标志。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DoxasticTenure|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The reified, time-scoped fact that a DoxasticState was held over an interval — the belief-revision history construct. Opened when the belief is adopted; closed (endedAtTime on the duringInterval) and suppressed with displayable false when the holder itself revises or retracts the belief; another party's dispute of the belief never closes or suppresses it. The old DoxasticState is retained as audit, never deleted (Principle 10). Carries its interval via gmeow:duringInterval (temporal module) and links to the scoped DoxasticState via tenureOfDoxasticState."
msgstr "经过具体化、限定时间的事实：某个 DoxasticState 在一个区间内被持有——信念修订历史的构造。信念被采纳时开启；持有者自己修订或撤回信念时，关闭（duringInterval 上的 endedAtTime）并以 displayable false 隐藏；另一方对该信念的质疑绝不会关闭或隐藏它。旧的 DoxasticState 作为审计记录保留，绝不删除（原则 10）。通过 gmeow:duringInterval（时间模块）携带其区间，并通过 tenureOfDoxasticState 链接到所限定的 DoxasticState。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DoxasticTenure|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Mint one DoxasticTenure per DoxasticState adoption interval; point it at the DoxasticState via tenureOfDoxasticState and at a TimeInterval via duringInterval. When the holder revises its own belief, close the interval with endedAtTime and set displayable false on the tenure; mint a new DoxasticState and tenure for the revised belief. Another party's dispute of the belief is not a revision and sets no flag."
msgstr "为每个 DoxasticState 的采纳区间创建一个 DoxasticTenure；通过 tenureOfDoxasticState 指向该 DoxasticState，通过 duringInterval 指向 TimeInterval。持有者修订自己的信念时，用 endedAtTime 关闭区间并在该 tenure 上设置 displayable false；为修订后的信念创建新的 DoxasticState 和 tenure。另一方对该信念的质疑不是修订，不设置任何标志。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/defeatedBy|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid pointing it at a gmeow:JustificationStatus value (that is the flag gmeow:hasDefeatStatus) — gmeow:defeatedBy names the structural defeater (an Argument, claim, or evidence span), not the verdict; and avoid treating it as a deletion signal or as a reason to set gmeow:displayable false: a defeated claim stays retrievable and its display is reader policy (Principle 10)."
msgstr "避免将其指向 gmeow:JustificationStatus 值（那是标志 gmeow:hasDefeatStatus）——gmeow:defeatedBy 指明结构性的击败者（Argument、主张或证据片段），而不是裁决；也避免将其视为删除信号，或设置 gmeow:displayable false 的理由：被击败的主张仍可检索，其显示属于读者策略（原则 10）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hasDefeatStatus|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid pointing it at the structural defeater (that is gmeow:defeatedBy -> gmeow:Defeater) or treating it as a reasoner-entailed truth bit or deletion signal; it is not a reason to set gmeow:displayable false, because a defeated claim stays retrievable and its display is reader policy (Principle 10)."
msgstr "避免将其指向结构性击败者（那是 gmeow:defeatedBy → gmeow:Defeater），或将其视为推理机蕴涵的真值位或删除信号；它不是设置 gmeow:displayable false 的理由，因为被击败的主张仍可检索，其显示属于读者策略（原则 10）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WithdrawnDoxasticTenureSuppressionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: a withdrawn belief (a gmeow:DoxasticTenure whose gmeow:duringInterval carries a gmeow:endedAtTime) should set gmeow:displayable false — suppressed from display, never deleted (Principle 10). It concerns a holder revising or withdrawing its own belief; a dispute by another party closes no tenure and is not reported."
msgstr "封闭世界完整性约束：被撤回的信念（其 gmeow:duringInterval 带有 gmeow:endedAtTime 的 gmeow:DoxasticTenure）应设置 gmeow:displayable false——隐藏，绝不删除（原则 10）。它涉及持有者修订或撤回自己的信念；另一方的质疑不会关闭任何 tenure，也不会被报告。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/putForwardByClaim|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "put forward by claim"
msgstr "由主张提出"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/putForwardByClaim|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:skyStatement rdf:reifies <<( ex:sky ex:hasColour ex:blue )>> ; gmeow:putForwardByClaim ex:aliceSaysBlue ."
msgstr "ex:skyStatement rdf:reifies <<( ex:sky ex:hasColour ex:blue )>> ; gmeow:putForwardByClaim ex:aliceSaysBlue ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/putForwardByClaim|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The relation links a statement reifier to its claim token and does nothing else. It copies no annotation between the two, entails no gmeow:expresses proposition, and has no display, ranking or lifecycle effect on either end. The at-most-one-token obligation is carried by gmeow:putForwardByClaimFunctionality."
msgstr "该关系只把陈述的具体化者关联到其主张令牌，别无其他作用。它不在二者之间复制任何标注，不蕴含任何 gmeow:expresses 命题，对任何一端都没有显示、排序或生命周期方面的效果。至多一个令牌的义务由 gmeow:putForwardByClaimFunctionality 承载。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/putForwardByClaim|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a claim recorded only as an RDF 1.2 reified statement must be evaluated, supported or attacked as an assertion act: mint the claim token that stands for the act and link the reifier of the statement to it."
msgstr "当仅以 RDF 1.2 具体化陈述形式记录的主张必须作为断言行为被评估、支持或攻击时使用：创建代表该行为的主张令牌，并将陈述的具体化者关联到它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/putForwardByClaimFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "putForwardByClaim is functional"
msgstr "putForwardByClaim 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/putForwardByClaimFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:putForwardByClaim names at most one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:putForwardByClaim 至多命名一个值时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/putForwardByClaimFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/putForwardByClaimFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:putForwardByClaim, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:putForwardByClaim, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/putForwardByClaimFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:putForwardByClaim and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:putForwardByClaim (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."
msgstr "范围：该记录仅承载关于 gmeow:putForwardByClaim 的一项完整性义务，别无其他。它不是 gmeow:putForwardByClaim 的定义（定义位于术语自身），不是形状，也不是重述该术语含义的第二处位置——应撤回该记录而非扩大其范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/putForwardByClaimFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:putForwardByClaimFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:putForwardByClaim ."
msgstr "gmeow:putForwardByClaimFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:putForwardByClaim ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ClaimEvaluation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid for a bare defeat flag (use gmeow:hasDefeatStatus directly on the claim) and for the reasoner's truth verdict (that is logic:ReasoningResult); avoid letting one evaluation win over the rest — competing evaluations under different contexts coexist (Principle 9). Avoid treating an evaluation as an act on the evaluated claim: it never suppresses, ranks or replaces that claim, and it is no ground for setting gmeow:displayable false on it."
msgstr "不要用于单纯的击败标记（直接在主张上使用 gmeow:hasDefeatStatus），也不要用于推理器的真值裁断（那是 logic:ReasoningResult）；避免让某一项评估胜过其余评估——不同语境下相互竞争的评估并存（原则 9）。避免把评估当作对被评估主张施加的行为：评估绝不抑制、排序或取代该主张，也不构成对其设置 gmeow:displayable false 的理由。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/evaluates|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid pointing it at a bare gmeow:Proposition (evaluate the token, not the content) or at a gmeow:DoxasticState; the target is the assertion act (gmeow:ClaimToken). Avoid pointing it at the reifier of a reified statement; evaluate the claim token the reifier is linked to by gmeow:putForwardByClaim."
msgstr "避免让它指向单纯的 gmeow:Proposition（评估的是令牌而非内容）或 gmeow:DoxasticState；其目标是断言行为（gmeow:ClaimToken）。避免让它指向具体化陈述的具体化者；应评估该具体化者经 gmeow:putForwardByClaim 所关联的主张令牌。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/putForwardByClaim|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Relates the reifier of an RDF 1.2 reified statement to the gmeow:ClaimToken, the datable assertion act, by which that statement was put forward. It bridges a claim that exists only as a reified statement to the claim apparatus, so that a gmeow:ClaimEvaluation can judge it through gmeow:evaluates, whose target stays a claim token. The reifier remains a reifier: the relation does not make it a claim token or an activity, and it does not assert the reified triple. Functional: the relation applies to a reifier that names one attributed occurrence of a statement, the statement as one source put it forward on one occasion, and such a reifier has at most one claim token. This is a precondition on the data, not a property of every reifier: give each assertion act that is to be evaluated its own named reifier. A reifier shared by several sources, including the content-addressed reifier the statement compiler mints from the triple alone when no reifier is named, is never linked to a claim token; when two sources state the same triple, name a separate reifier of that triple for each act and link each to its own token, and the acts coexist (Principle 9). Not inverse functional: one assertion act may put forward several statements, so several reifiers may share one claim token, and an evaluation of that token judges everything the act put forward."
msgstr "将 RDF 1.2 具体化陈述的具体化者关联到提出该陈述的 gmeow:ClaimToken，即可标注日期的断言行为。它把仅以具体化陈述形式存在的主张接入主张机制，使 gmeow:ClaimEvaluation 能够通过 gmeow:evaluates 对其作出评判，而 gmeow:evaluates 的目标仍是主张令牌。具体化者仍然是具体化者：该关系不会使其成为主张令牌或活动，也不断言被具体化的三元组。函数性：该关系适用于命名陈述的一次有归属的出现的具体化者，即某一来源在某一场合提出的该陈述，这样的具体化者至多有一个主张令牌。这是对数据的前提条件，而不是所有具体化者都具有的性质：应为每一个需要被评估的断言行为提供它自己的具名具体化者。由多个来源共用的具体化者，包括在未命名具体化者时陈述编译器仅根据三元组生成的按内容寻址的具体化者，绝不关联到主张令牌；当两个来源陈述同一三元组时，应为每个行为各命名该三元组的一个独立具体化者，并将其各自关联到自己的令牌，这些行为并存（原则 9）。非反函数性：一次断言行为可以提出多条陈述，因此多个具体化者可以共用一个主张令牌，而对该令牌的评估所评判的是该行为提出的全部内容。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/putForwardByClaim|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid pointing gmeow:evaluates at the reifier itself, typing the reifier as a gmeow:ClaimToken, or linking one reifier to two claim tokens. Avoid linking a reifier that several sources share, such as a content-addressed reifier minted from the triple alone: it names no single assertion act, so name a reifier for each act instead. Avoid it for the propositional content a token conveys (gmeow:expresses) and for the event in which a token was uttered (gmeow:producesClaim)."
msgstr "避免让 gmeow:evaluates 直接指向具体化者本身，避免将具体化者类型化为 gmeow:ClaimToken，也避免把一个具体化者关联到两个主张令牌。避免关联由多个来源共用的具体化者，例如仅根据三元组生成的按内容寻址的具体化者：它不命名任何单一的断言行为，应改为给每个行为各命名一个具体化者。不要将其用于令牌所传达的命题内容（gmeow:expresses），也不要用于令牌被说出时所在的事件（gmeow:producesClaim）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/putForwardByClaim|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Give the statement a named reifier of its own for the one assertion act to be evaluated, mint one gmeow:ClaimToken for that act, give the token its performing agent with gmeow:wasAssociatedWith and its frame with gmeow:accordingTo, and assert this relation from the reifier to the token. Point gmeow:evaluates at the token; the evaluation judges everything that act put forward, so link to one token only the statements of one act. To reach the evaluated statement from an evaluation, follow gmeow:evaluates to the token and this relation back to the reifier."
msgstr "为需要被评估的那一个断言行为给陈述提供它自己的具名具体化者，为该行为创建一个 gmeow:ClaimToken，用 gmeow:wasAssociatedWith 给出令牌的执行主体，用 gmeow:accordingTo 给出其框架，然后断言从具体化者到令牌的这一关系。让 gmeow:evaluates 指向该令牌；评估所评判的是该行为提出的全部内容，因此只把同一行为的陈述关联到同一个令牌。要从一项评估找到被评估的陈述，先沿 gmeow:evaluates 到达令牌，再沿这一关系反向回到具体化者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/putForwardByClaimFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:putForwardByClaim is functional: one statement reifier is linked to at most one gmeow:ClaimToken, so the assertion act behind a reified statement is never ambiguous. The bound presupposes a reifier that names one attributed occurrence of a statement; a reifier shared by several sources is not linked to a token at all. The inverse direction is deliberately not constrained: one assertion act may put forward several statements, so several reifiers may share one token, and an evaluation of that token judges the whole act and every statement linked to it, not one statement. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:putForwardByClaim 是函数性的：一个陈述具体化者至多关联到一个 gmeow:ClaimToken，因此具体化陈述背后的断言行为绝不含糊。该上限以具体化者命名陈述的一次有归属的出现为前提；由多个来源共用的具体化者根本不关联到任何令牌。反方向有意不加约束：一次断言行为可以提出多条陈述，因此多个具体化者可以共用一个令牌，而对该令牌的评估所评判的是整个行为以及关联到它的每一条陈述，而不是单独一条陈述。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：该义务是由该记录推理得出的，而非在别处重述。"
